- @page_title = "Join the Team"
.container
  .row
    .span7
      %h1.title= @page_title
      #mission
      %p
        Action.IO is revolutionizing the way the world builds applications by moving your development runtime to the cloud. We are looking for remarkable people to help us effect the next paradigm shift in programming.
      %p
        Action.IO was founded in June of 2012 and has offices in San Francisco and Singapore.

      %article#jobs
        #jpost
          %h3 Dev Ops Engineer
          %p.desc
            Dev Ops are the heart of the Action.IO platform. You are an automation wizard, you have rube goldberg&rsquo;ed your entire morning routine, and you are looking to take those skills elsewhere.

          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li
                Familiarity with Amazon Web Services
              %li
                Experience administering large scale production server environments
              %li
                Solid knowledge of scripting languages
              %li
                Ability to identify and smash performance bottlenecks
              %li
                Familiarity with common open source web service infrastructure: Nginx, HAProxy, Memcached, Redis, PostgreSQL, etc
              %li
                Experience with monitoring systems and configuration management tools like Chef, Puppet, Capistrano, Nagios, Cacti, etc.
              %li
                A degree in Computer Science or related technical field

          %p.actions
