          %p.desc
            Want to know the secret to our kickass product? We use Action.IO to build Action.IO.
          %p.reqs
            %ul
              %li
                Solid knowledge of Ruby on Rails, Node.js, Test-Driven Development, and Front-end Frameworks like Backbone and Ember
              %li
                Ability to learn and implement new and unfamiliar technologies
              %li
                A passion for cloud computing and optimization
              %li
                Obsessive attention to detail
              %li
                Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of whats possible
              %li
                Experience in building massive-scale production quality systems
              %li
                A degree in Computer Science or related technical field

